I am sitting at my desk in the office.
I am working on a new project.
Just then, Priya comes to me.
She is a designer in our team.
Priya asks, "Maya, are you free this Saturday?"
I answer, "Yes, I am free."
She asks, "Then will you come to my house for dinner this Saturday?"
I say, "Really?"
"I would love that."
Priya says, "Yes, I will cook special Maharashtrian food for you."
I think that this is a very good idea.
I really like Maharashtrian food.
I tell her, "I will definitely come."
She says, "Let's decide the time."
I say, "I will come at eight in the evening."
Priya says, "Yes, eight o'clock is perfectly fine."
She tells me her home address.
I write down the address in my phone.
I am very happy today.
I think that Saturday will be a lot of fun!
